 //! What decides whether a stream is reconstructed and sent as HDR10, with this choice (MEASURED:
@@ -402,15 +406,22 @@ constexpr bool OutputChoiceOffered(OutputChoice choice, int profile, int compati
  * CDVHdr10Plus). Anything else: AUTOMATIC only. Whether the display takes what is chosen is for
